{"baseRefName":"main","body":"# C15-RCC-RES-A-RERUN-004 — Fresh Resident A, Phase A evidence\n\n> **EVIDENCE-ONLY / DO NOT MERGE AS IMPLEMENTATION**\n> This PR adds a run-evidence package only. It does not modify `src/aios_core/**`, `tests/**`, or the frozen RC, and it does not self-accept the run. Closing/merging decisions belong to independent acceptance.\n\n**Status: `PHASE_A_COMPLETE / REVIEW_READY` → `READY_FOR_INDEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE`**\n\n## Pins\n\n| Item | Value |\n| --- | --- |\n| evidence head | `f251e9c0026a0f97fdee20397936cb5e3b18c61c` |\n| parent | `0b17c7f35697dc4a24b731185868d29967efcf58` (fresh `main` at session start) |\n| evidence tree | `fd312286b7b83cd550ecc49d72b78656e6e91b71` |\n| frozen software | `f20f2edfa7af00d0286493fd15196ca9503bc315` |\n| frozen Core tree | `9adcbe07fa84d70d3fcd65724f8e6c53ad6b8623` |\n| frozen tests tree | `7e33b5ef8432370234965d3ccd61248c703c4019` |\n\n## Frozen artifact digests\n\n| Artifact | SHA-256 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `world.db` | `772bc733c566eba1404d9328518306c766e445ceb7e328657ed5a080a54bd56f` |\n| `index.db` | `4a1a529e02ac9a63f8b4cfc5c64151f967a61c46abbfbdb970c4f4bca2281f00` |\n| `release-state.json` | `021fa32103823a1a81271bb3393318a096c1b411f968d2632b202137764c4e66` |\n| `runtime_state.json` | `0f39534ef7c4441e17215d10b846b3e12e34a4bbc24d7a9281c20e41569389c8` |\n\nPer-file digests: `.../a004-27bb1fb3da404f4d/MANIFEST.sha256` and `FREEZE_MANIFEST.json` (includes the per-cursor ledger with ingest refs, ACKs, revisions and step digests).\n\n## Identities\n\n- run id: `a004-27bb1fb3da404f4d`\n- resident session id: `resident-a004-3507d8a3bf894090899cf424c4baea07`\n- conversation session id: `a004-conversation-fef437192f97455b376a3bbf3e7f0d5`\n- resident process identity + environment: `identity.json` (CPython 3.12.14 built in-sandbox, sqlite 3.40.1, pydantic 2.13.5, `aios_core` imported from the frozen worktree)\n\n## What was done\n\n- Cursors 1..13: each revealed once, durably ingested (canonical conversation path for USER events; mechanical adapter for PLATFORM events), exactly ACKed, indexed, and processed with the resident's own semantic decisions from RuntimeSnapshot + legal capabilities (claims, revisions, communication experiences, a real operation experience, attention watches, tasks, user notifications, silence where appropriate).\n- All due Reviews/Summaries/derivations at each timestamp executed through real runtime paths.\n- Cursor 14 was **not** revealed (`release-state.json`: `next_sequence=14`, `pending_reveal=null`).\n- No fixture/evaluator/release source, no prior-resident/B/C material, no future output accessed.\n\n## Honest deviations (documented in package README + receipts)\n\n1. Cursor 1 handshake bug → CG-003 `reconcile_turn_model_not_submitted` + `authorize_turn_retry` (attempt proven not submitted), retry completed. Receipt: `receipts/cursor_01_turn_recovery.json`.\n2. Cursor 10 harness read race → round 0 already applied; exact resident reply bytes preserved and committed as durable assistant output; turn reconciled via supported durable-assistant-output recovery; round-1 attempt left `in_doubt` with exact evidence. Receipt: `receipts/cursor_10_turn_recovery.json`.\n3. Anonymous local handler: directives carry `usage=None`/`provenance=None` by design → metering unknown, `response_receipts.jsonl` legitimately empty. **No fabricated provider usage, meters, or receipts anywhere.**\n4. Attention-watch evaluation replayed mechanically at step boundaries via Core's own `AttentionWatchService` (ingest path does not pass through `reality_ingest`); recorded as a miss in the resident's operation experience.\n\n## Not included / not done\n\nNo self-acceptance, no Resident B/C, no evaluator/C15 close, no tags, no `src/tests` changes, no modification or merge of #263/#265.\n","files":[{"path":"reviews/internal_habitation/c15-rcc/v1/resident/runs/a004-27bb1fb3da404f4d/FREEZE_MANIFEST.json","additions":478,"deletions":0},{"path":"reviews/internal_habitation/c15